  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JFP Invest AS - Resin tapping</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Introduction of modern pine resin production to Tanzanian farmers, significantly increasing revenues for the farmers by creating a comprehensive value chain. The project has significant climate change adaption and mitigation effects, potential to create a great number of jobs and income for farmers in deprived rural areas and provide environmental benefits, tax income and export revenues for Tanzania.</narrative>
  </description>
